    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86166.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, I'm sure all the fetuses and the children, the unborn children are pretty scared too, Jen. They're pretty scared too. Some of them are women. Some of them are little girls or females. You know what? In other parts of the world where I've been in China, when they had the one child law, they would abort and kill the babies even after they were born because they didn't want to have female. They didn't want to have daughters because they felt that their sons would, you know, be able to add more to the family than the daughter. So what about those? What about those children? Jen Psaki, what about the kids, you know, in countries like India and stuff, or across the globe, across the globe, in places where women have no rights, right? We have to also consider the potential life, the life of the child. They don't have anyone advocating for them. Who's advocating for them? And it's like supposed to be a bad thing, supposed to be a bad thing? that when someone stands up for the right of a child, what kind of twisted world do we live in? What kind of twisted world do we live in? And by the way, the White House is responsible for this because they're allowing people to march through. And by the way, our AGs, our Attorney Generals that aren't doing anything about it here or the police, arresting people that are disturbing the peace in neighborhoods. Look. There is a time and a place for everything, and you don't need to be in someone's neighborhood threatening our Supreme Court justices for doing their jobs. And the majority of people that were there protesting, I guarantee you, never read one of the opinions. They are brainwashed by these crazy professors in these institutions that have turned our country upside down into Marxists kind of socialist ideology that our young children have basically adopted and integrated into their lives. I couldn't even believe some of the young girls that I saw there standing there with like these environmental shirts that were like save the earth by aborting our children, by aborting humanity. It's insane, guys. It's insane. And I'm going to be here all week covering that story. I know we have Congressman Biggs coming up very shortly. And I'm going to bring him on. I'm going to ask him all of these questions. I do want to touch base with something that is also very important to me. And I haven't talked about it in a long time and that's Afghanistan. And I was just on the phone this week with my interpreter, my former interpreter. who I was able to get out of Afghanistan with his child and his wife. And, you know, we were talking about what's happening in the country and the rest of his family that's there. And it's just devastating. I mean, Biden also completely destroyed any gains we potentially could have had there. And and by the way, we lost our lily pad there. We lost our ability to kind of observe and and watch what China and the rest of our enemies are doing because we gave up all of the territory of Afghanistan. We didn't even hold on to Bagram. And you guys remember what that happened. Well, right now with Taliban rule, you know, the women are going back to the nightmare that they lived before. They're being forced to wear their, you know, uh, full burkas. I've, I actually have a burk I brought from Afghanistan. It weighs a ton and it's like you're living in a cage. It's the most horrific thing ever. Great job. Great job, uh, president Biden. You're amazing. You're just throwing the world back into the stone age. Literally literally throwing it. I mean, we're on the verge of world war three. We see what's happening in Ukraine. Look at what's happening with Russia. Our nation is just completely divided and falling apart. You're allowing the crazies to run the institution and run our streets. And by the way, I want all of you out there who are listening to me, do not allow the left to gaslight you. Just look at the reality of what is happening. Stick with that. Don't listen to their crazy words. Don't listen to Jen Psaki. Nobody's running away and seizing power in America. The Supreme Court is giving the right of abortion back up to the states. If that's what's going to happen based on these draft opinions, going back to the individual states, The left is literally trying to gaslight our country into total and utter destruction. Just look at what's happening at the border. The border is not safe, as Mayorkas is saying. He can say it till the cows come home. That border is wide open. Our country is more divided than it's ever been. There is inflation. We're going into a recession. Our economy is broken. And if we don't stop it, oh God, God only knows what can happen. And now in Afghanistan, we're seeing what's happening to the women, and we're seeing what's happening across the world. This is not a safer place. This is not a safer place. Before I get to congressman Andy Biggs, I know he's waiting there to join me. I want to talk to you about healthy cell. Now, you see, I'm bouncing all over the country, right? I am like all over the place. And the only way I stay healthy is by keeping up with my vitamins, doing my daily exercise, but healthy cell has made it just so much easier for me, guys. Healthy cell is the next generation in dietary supplements, by far the best. If you take regular supplements in pill form now, you're going to want to get rid of those. You're going to want to make a change. You're going to want to go to healthy cell. Why? Because studies show that you don't absorb most of the nutrients when you take them in pill form. But when you take them in a gel form, it's absolutely incredible. You have 165% more absorption. when you take it in jail, then you do with the pills. It is absolutely incredible. I tried it and I ditched the pills. I ditched them. And like I tell you, I feel a hundred times better when I'm at the border, whether I'm here with the protesters, whether I'm down in DC and I spend a lot of time walking. I feel like a million dollars with healthy cell journey to better health with healthy cell. go to healthycell.com, backslashcarder. That's healthycell.com, backslashcarder, and use promo code carder for 20% off your first order. Again, that's healthycell.com slash carder, promo code carder for 20% off your first order. First and foremost, thank you so much, Congressman Andy Biggs for joining the Sarah Carter show. It's always a pleasure to have you on the show, but I feel like I'm living in upside down land, and I know you and I were both just talking about this. What's happening in our country, the protests, we're seeing these pro-abortion activists, our border, our national security is at risk. The way the White House is handling I think the most significant issues of our time by not handling them, just allowing it to all fall apart, do you feel like we're living in a world that is completely an alterverse of where we were just a few years ago? A",
